              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='448' forceUpdate='true' h='15400' id='124' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='22244' x='43950' y='7400'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true'>Notes</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='8'>1. Data is pulled from Datahub and might not perfectly match braze. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='8'>2. Canvas names are blank for months for which we have no data in braze dataset but have data in NPS and Orders tables.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='8'>3. Canvas steps such as</run>
                <run fontsize='8' italic='true'> inapp-Survey-Clicked_Restaurants</run>
                <run fontsize='8'> have been excluded</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='8'>4. FP APAC, DH Greece, DH Nordics and Banabi had inconsistent canvas names in datahub, hence for each platforms, items consolidated in single canvas respectively.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='8'>5. HS- No canvas sent to Bahrain.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='405' forceUpdate='true' h='15400' id='155' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='20146' x='66194' y='7400'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontsize='8'>6. For Saudi Arabia- canvas sent only for HS and not for Talabat.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='8'>7. YS- No canvas sent to Turkey for local stores but NPS responses available for some test surveys.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='8'>8. DH CEE - No canvas sent for dmarts and local stores in Hungary and Slovakia.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
